#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/stackable.rst:2
msgid "stackable"
msgstr "stackable"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.StackableAnimation:1 of
msgid "可被记录到 :class:`~.AnimStack` 中的动画的基类"
msgstr "Base class for animations that can be recorded in :class:`~.AnimStack`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.StackableAnimation:3 of
msgid "主要实现 :meth:`apply` 的堆栈调用过程"
msgstr "Mainly implements the stack calling process of :meth:`apply`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.StackableAnimation.apply:1 of
msgid "具体请参考 :class:`StackableAnimation` 以及 :class:`ApplyParams` 的介绍"
msgstr "For details, see the descriptions of :class:`StackableAnimation` and :class:`ApplyParams`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.StackableAnimation.add_to_stack:1 of
msgid "将该动画添加到 ``item`` 的动画堆栈中"
msgstr "Adds this animation to the animation stack of ``item``"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:1 of
msgid "传递给 :meth:`apply` 的单对象参数"
msgstr "Single-object parameters passed to :meth:`apply`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:3 of
msgid "``data`` 表示当前计算中的物件状态，需要交由 :meth:`apply` 内部进行设置"
msgstr "``data`` represents the current item state being calculated and needs to be set inside :meth:`apply`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:5 of
msgid "它会从 ``None`` 开始，随着对 :meth:`apply` 函数的调用，而逐渐被应用各个动画效果"
msgstr "It starts as ``None`` and gradually has various animation effects applied to it through calls to :meth:`apply`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:7 of
msgid "一开始，``data`` 是 ``None``，并总是会被 :class:`~.Display` 设置初始值"
msgstr "Initially, ``data`` is ``None`` and is always initialized by :class:`~.Display`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:9 of
msgid ""
"因为我们在 :class:`~.AnimStack` 中 直接调用 :meth:`~.AnimStack.display` 记录了一个 :class:`Display` 对象， 所以动画堆栈中"
"的首个动画总是 :class:`~.Display`"
msgstr ""
"Because we directly call :meth:`~.AnimStack.display` in :class:`~.AnimStack` to record a :class:`Display` object, the "
"first animation in the animation stack is always :class:`~.Display`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:13 of
msgid ""
"随后，``data`` 每次都会被保留给下一个动画的 :meth:`apply` 函数， 从而随着动画堆栈应用效果，走完整个动画堆栈得出最终的显示"
"状态"
msgstr ""
"Afterwards, ``data`` is retained and passed to the next animation's :meth:`apply` function each time, allowing the entire "
"animation stack to be processed and the final display state to be obtained"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:16 of
msgid "对于 ``index`` 来说，它会从 ``0`` 开始，随着对 :meth:`apply` 函数的调用，而逐渐增加"
msgstr "For ``index``, it starts from ``0`` and gradually increases with each call to :meth:`apply`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:18 of
msgid "即表示当前调用的动画在 ``anims`` 中的下标"
msgstr "It represents the index of the currently applied animation in ``anims``"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:20 of
msgid "另外："
msgstr "Additionally:"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:22 of
msgid "``global_t`` 表示当前的全局时刻"
msgstr "``global_t`` represents the current global time"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:24 of
msgid "``index`` 表示当前动画在动画堆栈中的下标"
msgstr "``index`` represents the index of the current animation in the animation stack"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyParams:26 of
msgid "``anims`` 即为当前的完整动画堆栈"
msgstr "``anims`` is the complete current animation stack"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ItemAnimation:1 of
msgid "大多数针对物件的动画的基类"
msgstr "Base class for most item animations"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ItemAnimation:3 of
msgid "该类相比 :class:`StackableAnimation` 的主要区别是："
msgstr "The main differences between this class and :class:`StackableAnimation` are:"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ItemAnimation:5 of
msgid "自动将 ``item`` 加入 :class:`~.AnimStack` 的追踪"
msgstr "Automatically adds ``item`` to the tracking of :class:`~.AnimStack`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ItemAnimation:7 of
msgid "封装 ``show_at_begin`` 与 ``hide_at_end`` 参数，提供了相对直接的显示/隐藏时机的控制"
msgstr ""
"Wraps the ``show_at_begin`` and ``hide_at_end`` parameters, providing relatively direct control over when items are shown "
"or hidden"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:1 of
msgid "用于处理多个动画堆栈之间的联动"
msgstr "Used to handle coordination between multiple animation stacks"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:3 of
msgid "主要用于 :class:`~.GroupUpdater`"
msgstr "Mainly used for :class:`~.GroupUpdater`"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:5 of
msgid "说明："
msgstr "Description:"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:7 of
msgid "普通的 :class:`StackableAnimation` 只是单个动画堆栈从头 ``apply`` 到尾"
msgstr "A normal :class:`StackableAnimation` simply applies a single animation stack from beginning to end"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:9 of
msgid ""
"但是比如对于 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 而言， 它需要同时等待多个物件的动画堆栈到达一个预期的“闸”，当所有都“触闸”后， 这"
"个 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 才能开始执行，执行结束后“开闸”才让各个动画堆栈继续执行"
msgstr ""
"However, for example, :class:`~.GroupUpdater` needs to wait for the animation stacks of multiple items to reach an "
"expected \"gate\" simultaneously. Only after all have reached the gate can this :class:`~.GroupUpdater` begin execution. "
"After execution finishes, the \"gate\" opens and allows each animation stack to continue"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:13 of
msgid "机制："
msgstr "Mechanism:"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:15 of
msgid ""
"当 :class:`~.AnimStack` 在计算时，发现一个 :class:`ApplyAligner` 动画， 则会先调用其 :meth:`pre_apply` 方法，进行一些事先"
"准备（比如对于 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 而言，是将当前动画堆栈的计算状态同步到其内部的物件组上）"
msgstr ""
"When :class:`~.AnimStack` encounters an :class:`ApplyAligner` animation during computation, it first calls "
"its :meth:`pre_apply` method for preparation (for example, for :class:`~.GroupUpdater`, this synchronizes the current "
"animation stack's calculation state to its internal item group)"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:18 of
msgid ""
"调用完 :meth:`pre_apply` 方法后，:class:`~.AnimStack` 会使用 ``yield`` 暂时挂起当前动画堆栈的执行， 并触发需要等待的物件"
"（即构造参数所收集的 ``stacks``）的计算， 在它们都“触闸”后，正式执行 :meth:`StackableAnimation.apply` 方法，从而达到目标"
msgstr ""
"After calling :meth:`pre_apply`, :class:`~.AnimStack` uses ``yield`` to temporarily suspend the execution of the current "
"animation stack and triggers the computation of the items that need to wait (that is, the ``stacks`` collected from the "
"constructor arguments). After all of them have reached the \"gate\", it formally "
"executes :meth:`StackableAnimation.apply` to achieve the desired result"

#: janim.anims_core.stackable.ApplyAligner:22 of
msgid "注：对于同一组物件的 :class:`ApplyAligner` 需要传入同一个 ``stacks``，以保证 :meth:`identifier` 识别正确"
msgstr ""
"Note: For :class:`ApplyAligner` instances operating on the same group of items, the same ``stacks`` must be passed to "
"ensure that :meth:`identifier` identifies them correctly"

#~ msgid "将 ``global_t`` 时的动画效果作用到 ``data`` 上"
#~ msgstr "Apply the animation effect at ``global_t`` to ``data``"

#~ msgid "其中"
#~ msgstr "Where"

#~ msgid "对于 :class:`~.Display` 而言，``data`` 是 ``None``，返回值是 :class:`~.Item` 对象"
#~ msgstr "For :class:`~.Display`, ``data`` is ``None``, and the return value is a :class:`~.Item` object"

#~ msgid "而对于其它大多数的而言，``data`` 是前一个动画作用的结果，返回值是 ``None``"
#~ msgstr "For most others, ``data`` is the result of the previous animation, and the return value is ``None``"
